cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this benchmark, please cite it using the metadata below."
title: "Jev RAG Benchmark (English): Jev 1.13 vs NVIDIA cross-encoder vs no reranking"
abstract: >-
  A free, reproducible, framework-neutral English benchmark of TypeSafe Jev 1.13
  as the reranking and decision layer of a RAG pipeline, with frozen candidate
  pools, paired bootstrap confidence intervals, probability calibration, and
  confidence-gated decision modes. Published runs cost $0 on free tiers.
type: software
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/emretheus/jev-rag-benchmark"
keywords:
